        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put together the ultimate defence to protect your base in these post-apocalyptic wastelands! Every metal scrap will be needed to create unique and deadly towers and annihilate every enemy vehicle that comes your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend several post-apocalyptic bases in our challenging Scenarios or play in Endless Mode and see how long you can defend your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/26353639e7fa794e16763eea2fb15d0f.avif?t=1755621146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras_big/26353639e7fa794e16763eea2fb15d0f.avif?t=1755621146 width=800 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unique and deadly towers, each with unique abilities! Upgrade your towers' strengths to best suit your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/235e32eccc0c662e77bed9ab93ef0931.poster.avif?t=1755621146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/235e32eccc0c662e77bed9ab93ef0931.webm?t=1755621146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/235e32eccc0c662e77bed9ab93ef0931.mp4?t=1755621146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/5543ed50867c8313c16d14505feb7cf3.avif?t=1755621146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras_big/5543ed50867c8313c16d14505feb7cf3.avif?t=1755621146 width=800 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for as long as you can in Endless Mode! Infinite playtime and an ever-increasing number of enemies create a difficult and rewarding challenge! Choose which Scenarios to play in Endless Mode! Try to obtain the mastery badge in all 3 scenarios in Endless Mode as you change your strategies to fit the enemies invading your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/8b15b8efb3d6732d4b36e1d7c9650558.poster.avif?t=1755621146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/8b15b8efb3d6732d4b36e1d7c9650558.webm?t=1755621146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/8b15b8efb3d6732d4b36e1d7c9650558.mp4?t=1755621146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/87255f8d65ff4b26650c7c6de00c1cf5.avif?t=1755621146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras_big/87255f8d65ff4b26650c7c6de00c1cf5.avif?t=1755621146 width=800 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 3 challenging scenarios where you must defend your scrap base against an entourage of varying enemies, each scenario requiring different strategies and different towers! Each Scenario takes place in a new and interesting location! Explore Scrapland and defend the last strongholds of humanity! Gain badges for your success and try to get the mastery badge on all 3 scenarios!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/55ab6ab2d9f377dac6861b99b4499169.poster.avif?t=1755621146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/55ab6ab2d9f377dac6861b99b4499169.webm?t=1755621146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/55ab6ab2d9f377dac6861b99b4499169.mp4?t=1755621146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put together the ultimate defence to protect your base in these post-apocalyptic wastelands! Every metal scrap will be needed to create unique and deadly towers and annihilate every enemy vehicle that comes your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend several post-apocalyptic bases in our challenging Scenarios or play in Endless Mode and see how long you can defend your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/26353639e7fa794e16763eea2fb15d0f.avif?t=1755621146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras_big/26353639e7fa794e16763eea2fb15d0f.avif?t=1755621146 width=800 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unique and deadly towers, each with unique abilities! Upgrade your towers' strengths to best suit your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/235e32eccc0c662e77bed9ab93ef0931.poster.avif?t=1755621146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/235e32eccc0c662e77bed9ab93ef0931.webm?t=1755621146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/235e32eccc0c662e77bed9ab93ef0931.mp4?t=1755621146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/5543ed50867c8313c16d14505feb7cf3.avif?t=1755621146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras_big/5543ed50867c8313c16d14505feb7cf3.avif?t=1755621146 width=800 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for as long as you can in Endless Mode! Infinite playtime and an ever-increasing number of enemies create a difficult and rewarding challenge! Choose which Scenarios to play in Endless Mode! Try to obtain the mastery badge in all 3 scenarios in Endless Mode as you change your strategies to fit the enemies invading your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/8b15b8efb3d6732d4b36e1d7c9650558.poster.avif?t=1755621146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/8b15b8efb3d6732d4b36e1d7c9650558.webm?t=1755621146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/8b15b8efb3d6732d4b36e1d7c9650558.mp4?t=1755621146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/87255f8d65ff4b26650c7c6de00c1cf5.avif?t=1755621146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras_big/87255f8d65ff4b26650c7c6de00c1cf5.avif?t=1755621146 width=800 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 3 challenging scenarios where you must defend your scrap base against an entourage of varying enemies, each scenario requiring different strategies and different towers! Each Scenario takes place in a new and interesting location! Explore Scrapland and defend the last strongholds of humanity! Gain badges for your success and try to get the mastery badge on all 3 scenarios!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/55ab6ab2d9f377dac6861b99b4499169.poster.avif?t=1755621146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/55ab6ab2d9f377dac6861b99b4499169.webm?t=1755621146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658630/extras/55ab6ab2d9f377dac6861b99b4499169.mp4?t=1755621146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
